# centres-first algorithms on the (2,3) oblique pair: only the pair (PAIRA = old CENTERS3,
# PAIRB = old CENTERS7) and the two mid orbits (MID2 = old CENTERS2 at depth 2, MID3 = old
# CENTERS5 at depth 3) are kept.  Corners, edges, diagonals (old CENTERS, CENTERS4) dropped.
# Keeping MID2 and MID3 colour-solved is exactly keeping every other oblique orbit on any n.
